# GS-002: Dissolution makes carbon dioxide and nitrogen pressurise differently
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
seal v1 500mL
add v1 N2 0.002mol
measure v1 pressure
inspect v1
new
add v2 water 100mL
seal v2 500mL
add v2 CO2 0.002mol
measure v2 pressure
inspect v2
